{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.poster.avif?t=1756454584\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.webm?t=1756454584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551550/extras/bfee8bb2ba79321500c169fe838de037.mp4?t=1756454584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ending.<br> But the truth lies in what's left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an asteroid speeds toward Earth, Seoul has fallen into ruin. In <i>Goodbye Seoul</i>, you play as Rion, a student navigating a collapsed city in search of answers\u2014trailing the remnants of a secret space evacuation project that may be humanity\u2019s final chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hauntingly beautiful post-apocalyptic Seoul in this story-rich puzzle-platformer. Solve environmental puzzles and piece together the mystery behind the covert operation. But beware\u2014this city isn\u2019t empty.<br>From unstable ruins to hostile survivors, every step forward is a risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>About the</strong>\u00a0<strong>Story</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Six months until an asteroid impact. Hope is the first to fall. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla